    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel back over 2,000 years and walk in the footsteps of Jesus Christ \u2014 from His baptism to the resurrection. Inspired by the New Testament, <i>I Am Jesus Christ</i> offers a unique spiritual simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e021064866320bb0adc2fbade43742dd.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e021064866320bb0adc2fbade43742dd.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to resist temptation in the desert, heal the sick, and uplift those in need? Perform over 30 meaningful miracles \u2014 from feeding the 5,000 and healing lepers to calming the storm and restoring sight to the blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.mp4?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deepen your connection with the Holy Spirit through prayer, as new gameplay mechanics blend with timeless biblical stories. <i>I Am Jesus Christ</i> seeks to share the Gospel in an engaging and respectful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/d5f1667cc47e0176f82a0b7f143e62a5.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/d5f1667cc47e0176f82a0b7f143e62a5.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience over 10 hours of immersive gameplay through deserts, waters, and mountains \u2014 leading to the profound story of Christ\u2019s crucifixion and resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Relive the life of Jesus Christ from His birth to the crucifixion and resurrection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Visit faithfully recreated locations in the Holy Land, including Jerusalem and the Galilee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Perform over 30 powerful miracles, such as feeding the 5,000 and walking on water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Be guided by the Holy Spirit, and strengthen your spiritual connection through prayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Meet over 60 story-driven characters, including the disciples of Christ. Reenact key moments such as the Last Supper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel back over 2,000 years and walk in the footsteps of Jesus Christ \u2014 from His baptism to the resurrection. Inspired by the New Testament, <i>I Am Jesus Christ</i> offers a unique spiritual simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e021064866320bb0adc2fbade43742dd.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e021064866320bb0adc2fbade43742dd.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to resist temptation in the desert, heal the sick, and uplift those in need? Perform over 30 meaningful miracles \u2014 from feeding the 5,000 and healing lepers to calming the storm and restoring sight to the blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.mp4?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deepen your connection with the Holy Spirit through prayer, as new gameplay mechanics blend with timeless biblical stories. <i>I Am Jesus Christ</i> seeks to share the Gospel in an engaging and respectful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/d5f1667cc47e0176f82a0b7f143e62a5.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/d5f1667cc47e0176f82a0b7f143e62a5.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience over 10 hours of immersive gameplay through deserts, waters, and mountains \u2014 leading to the profound story of Christ\u2019s crucifixion and resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Relive the life of Jesus Christ from His birth to the crucifixion and resurrection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Visit faithfully recreated locations in the Holy Land, including Jerusalem and the Galilee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Perform over 30 powerful miracles, such as feeding the 5,000 and walking on water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Be guided by the Holy Spirit, and strengthen your spiritual connection through prayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Meet over 60 story-driven characters, including the disciples of Christ. Reenact key moments such as the Last Supper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.poster.avif?t=1753293597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.webm?t=1753293597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Walk in the footsteps of Jesus in this immersive first-person retelling of His life \u2014 from birth to resurrection. Perform powerful miracles, meet biblical figures, and explore the Holy Land from Jerusalem to the Galilee. Become the Messiah in I Am Jesus Christ.",
